    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>7级 杂兵 远程</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 精界 类人生物</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 1；失手攻击无法伤害杂兵</span><span>''先攻'' +7</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 21，''强韧'' 18，''反射'' 21，''意志'' 19</span><span>''侦查'' +10</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6</span><span>''感官'' 昏暗视觉</span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/range}}力场箭（力场，武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：射程 20（一个生物）+14vs.AC<br>命中：7 点力场伤害，且该雅灵可以推动目标一格。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">移动动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">妖精步舞（瞬移）✦遭遇</div>\n<div class=description>效果：该雅灵瞬移最多五格。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 12（+4）</span><span>''敏捷'' 18（+7）</span><span>''感知'' 14（+5）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 13（+4）</span><span>''智力'' 14（+5）</span><span>''魅力'' 11（+3）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 通用语，精灵语</span></div></div>\n</div>",
